<title>CANADA: Canada C$2.7 bln bond due 2001 yields 5.273 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada C$2.7 bln bond due 2001 yields 5.273 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government of Canada said its C$2.7 billion auction of 7.0 percent bonds due September 1, 2001 produced the following results:</p>
<p>			     YIELD	 PRICE</p>
<p>		   AVG     5.273     107.157  PCT AT</p>
<p>		   LOW     5.268     107.178  HI YIELD</p>
<p>		   HIGH    5.279     107.131   35.5</p>
<p>The bonds will be dated and delivered on December 2. The outstanding debt of the issue totals C$10.6 billion. Bids from primary dealers totalled C$6,381.475 million, including C$71.475 million non-competitive tenders at the average yield.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
